  "notes": "Inventory covers the current shipped Window.setShape method (Chrome 154+), the pre-154 legacy IsolatedWebApp.setShape alias, and the two pre-154 namespace attributes (Window.chromeos, ChromeOS.isolatedWebApp). At Chrome 154 (shipped stable October 2026), the API entry point was promoted directly to Window.setShape(rects) per the vendor specification and Chromium SetShape runtime feature, renaming from IsolatedWebApp.setShape. The legacy name is preserved and tested as an alias for backwards compatibility. DOMRectReadOnly is an external input type (Geometry Interfaces), not feature surface. The Chrome Apps predecessor (chrome.app.window.setShape) is historical context."
